eges in their database. You can search any school and find names of the coaching staff and some info about the school. Are they NCAA? If so, what division? NAIA? JUCO? Are they competetive athletically in the sport? Do they have strict academic requirements? Etc...\n\nI believe that there are some people out there that offer this same service for less.\n\n2) Coach review of video\n\nYou can schedule a coach to assess the player's skill based on video you provide.  Then you set an appointment and talk about it. With the tier of service we got, we can ask for this an unlimited number of times.\n\nBut if you know honest coaches and trainers, they can do the same for you.","createdAt":"2025-09-29T04:28:03.000Z","replyCount":3,"reactionCount":0,"repliesCursor":"","author":{"name":"Nelson Ocampo","platformUserId":"584931665","shortName":"Nelson"}},{"id":"Y29tbWVudDoyNzc3Njk5OTY1NzM3MTE1XzI3ODQzNDM5Nzg0MDYwNDc=","text":"I know of some client families that have used them and the colleges they match or have coaches contact you from often are the wrong fit schools as they don’t have the kids major or college profile.  It’s an individual decision, and I find for sports that recruit based on times like track and field and swimming, not worth it as there are better sites out there.","createdAt":"2025-09-29T14:28:13.000Z","replyCount":0,"reactionCount":1,"repliesCursor":"","author":{"name":"Roger Strong Jr","platformUserId":"pfbid028xJ4PcKvdu5A5CHCJ3SuvF4U5zRSy6QFNin8JWzA8Y7BcnmkkPhuNNx5r57WCsn6l","shortName":"Roger"}}],"page":{"nextCursor":"MToxNzkzOTg0NTgwOgF_lK2W342MhXTlQ3IrRLQPguK6w1lZtZ599I_qdNRuOvxATHzFoLzD-lAGYJN5ckIywdToAO1trLzIDd3JFTLx1v613mePYCOYzjTJT3yUpfDbUiYcuRWzBDCh9fSK3OfzzLjk0_Zcj9G7r6qijLmMyf5xItaS_qwqa_1U9C3KjYdPLpPxL2-7TyjaWp40JQVtNygqJg_UzAZZBLGdiBa3pKm6A7WRxlJolOzcsiPBJCamEWy0S0LEwYgObRZlZJ0_6Bk6DNEdTv9utkgvEud9Q6OnBpjohDQU0OXrbbjV4p34TH6odi4aUFAHGhtRY4Xe8XHwrxdWQsyWu0lvhHa2GKNHg3CC3hARiAMAJ3NlJ6qOkONxMn8Jfde7ZIcMtXMP0z4q0cgNZq-TbeQrrS4nQsLbcar6EtXa8o5HioK_32